- Use flexbox for one-dimensional layouts
- Use grid for two-dimensional layouts
- Use spacing utilities consistently
- Use relative positioning with absolute children
- Use overflow to manage content overflow

### DON'T ❌
- Don't mix margin and padding for the same purpose
- Don't use fixed widths for responsive layouts
- Don't overuse absolute positioning
- Don't forget about dark mode compatibility
- Don't override utilities with inline styles unnecessarily

---

## Browser Support

All box utilities are supported in:
- ✅ Chrome 90+
- ✅ Firefox 88+
- ✅ Safari 14+
- ✅ Edge 90+

Grid layout is supported in all modern browsers.

