## Best Practices

### DO ✅
- Use consistent border radius throughout the application
- Use focus rings for keyboard accessibility
- Use semantic border colors for status indicators
- Test borders in both light and dark modes
- Use subtle borders for grouping content

### DON'T ❌
- Don't use thick borders (2px max recommended)
- Don't mix border styles randomly
- Don't use rounded corners without reason
- Don't remove focus rings without replacement
- Don't use bright borders that distract from content

---

## Accessibility

- ✅ Focus rings visible for keyboard navigation
- ✅ Border contrast meets WCAG AA standards
- ✅ Focus indicators visible in both light and dark modes
- ✅ Ring offset doesn't overlap content
- ✅ Outline removal requires alternative focus indicator

---

